Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.80,0:00:55.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俄罗斯当局今天准备应付民众…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The authorities in Russia are bracing themselves today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.68,0:00:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,针对前亿万富翁尤里·科马洛夫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for mass protests against the trial
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.97,0:01:00.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开庭一事的大规模抗议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of former billionaire Yuri Komarov.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.31,0:01:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,目前俄罗斯公众…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The case against Mr. Komarov
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对尤里·科马洛夫一案存在着巨大的意见分歧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has caused widespread division amongst the Russian public,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.14,0:01:08.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一部分人认为 他被判刑是国防部长候选人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of whom view his incarceration as a political maneuver
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.65,0:01:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是这个人…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}orchestrated by this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.15,0:01:13.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,维克多·查格林操纵的政治手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}defense minister candidate Viktor Chagarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.12,0:01:21.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有何贵干？维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want Viktor?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.63,0:01:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你挺有闲情雅致的嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.88,0:01:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天你准备怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want to accomplish tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我准备为自己赎罪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm prepared to pay for my sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.35,0:01:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也应该准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should prepare yourself too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.90,0:01:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:58.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,理智一点吧 我们曾经是朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}let's be civil about this. We were friends once...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.49,0:02:01.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也可以再次成为朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...are could be again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把文件交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give me the file...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.04,0:02:09.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就可以重回原有的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I'll hand your life back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.25,0:02:15.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,忘了这次愚蠢的审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forget this stupid trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.51,0:02:19.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我并不留恋以前的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want my life hack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.64,0:02:32.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我会让你明天在法庭上开口吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think I'm going to let you talk tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.36,0:02:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有人会听到你的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one is going to hear you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.57,0:02:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,法庭里都是我的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I own everybody in that courtroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't own me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.60,0:02:53.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(中央情报局总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.05,0:02:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迈克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.30,0:03:01.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查格林要对科马洛夫动手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chagarin's making a move on Komarov.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.26,0:03:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 见鬼 - 找那边的人处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit. - I'll see if we got local.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.80,0:03:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(莫斯科)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.30,0:03:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《虎胆龙威5》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.21,0:04:14.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们准备好开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are ready to get started.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.29,0:04:16.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.34,0:04:24.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会让我失望吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't disappoint me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:32.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我什么时候让你失望过？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have I ever disappointed you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anton.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.36,0:04:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃里克 我是维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alik, it's Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:46.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里·科马洛夫向你问好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri Komarov says hello...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.49,0:04:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是时候抓他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time to grab him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.70,0:04:50.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里·科马洛夫？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri Komarov?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and GOODBYE.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.07,0:05:22.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好 墨菲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Murph, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很准嘛 老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice grouping, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.57,0:05:29.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 还不赖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:33.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.91,0:05:36.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 找到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep. We found him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.33,0:05:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过不太妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not good, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.84,0:05:42.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,医院还是太平间？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hospital or morgue?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.09,0:05:45.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.38,0:05:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最后一次联系是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you spoke to this kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.81,0:05:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有一阵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:57.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概有好几年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe a few years, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们上次见面很不愉快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last time I saw him, it was pretty ugly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.11,0:06:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面有好几种说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a few different versions in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:12.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我的人确定他被关在莫斯科一所监狱里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but my people are pretty sure he's being held at a Moscow prison
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在等候宣判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}awaiting sentencing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么罪名？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's he charged with?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.00,0:06:18.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多了去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a nasty sheet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.83,0:06:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能判无期就算走运了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'll be lucky to get life.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.01,0:06:29.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那小子就会惹麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He can never get out of his own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.30,0:06:33.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一身臭毛病\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a lot of problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.93,0:06:37.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可毕竟是我儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's still my kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.31,0:06:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:45.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可那是俄罗斯 他们有他们的做法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's Russia. They do things differently over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.24,0:06:49.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.78,0:06:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祝你好运 老爹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good luck, Poppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.99,0:06:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.01,0:07:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God damn you! God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎来到肯尼迪国际机场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to John F. Kennedy International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.32,0:07:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱恩 祝你好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McClane, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.41,0:07:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回头见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See you soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.00,0:07:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(俄罗斯航空公司)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.00,0:07:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(案件调查报告)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.16,0:09:01.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说你有东西要交给我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was told you had something to offer me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.04,0:09:07.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在寻找尤里·科马洛夫的犯罪证据？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're looking for evidence against Yuri Komarov?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.96,0:09:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:19.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我和他一起上法庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put me in the courtroom with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.76,0:09:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以指证是他雇我谋杀安东\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and I'll testify that Komarov hired me to murder Anton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.10,0:09:24.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以宣誓作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll testify under oath.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样做够了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's good enough, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.61,0:10:16.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,…大干斯科法院？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...Draganskiy courthouse?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:18.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会说俄语？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You speak Russian?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得还行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.12,0:10:24.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 你说要买一大袋头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you asked for a large bag of hair
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.70,0:10:27.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带去塔干斯卡亚法院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the way to Taganskaya courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.21,0:10:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我听懂了 听懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.79,0:10:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.63,0:10:35.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里也老堵吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic sucks here, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赌？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sex?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.55,0:10:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想赌博？想找赌场？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want sex? Sexy clubs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.88,0:10:41.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是赌博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No sex.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.22,0:10:43.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说这里车很堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It sucks, this traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.39,0:10:45.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出事故了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it? An accident?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条路叫花园环路 一直很堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Garden Ring. Is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.89,0:10:53.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每天都很堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always traffic, always traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.86,0:10:56.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是美国人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're American?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.65,0:11:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 美国人 纽约来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, American. New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:03.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大苹果城\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Big Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:10.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我想从这座不夜城中慢慢醒来 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I want to wake up in that city that never sleeps ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
