Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.42,0:11:16.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:19.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,董事长 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chairman. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.59,0:11:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你唱得很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 这些小城的忧郁在渐渐融化 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ These little town blues are melting away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.60,0:11:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我爱唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.18,0:11:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从早唱到晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sing all the time.
