Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.77,0:11:35.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 山岭之王 世界之巅 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ King of the hill Top of the world ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.65,0:11:36.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.77,0:11:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高山 是高山之巅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Heap. "Top of the heap."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.36,0:11:44.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧 好吧 塔加斯卡亚法院就在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right. Taganskaya courthouse, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.53,0:11:45.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过两个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.74,0:11:49.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是走路吧 车太堵了 实在太堵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You better walk, traffic is bad. Really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.75,0:11:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I owe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.87,0:11:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 不要钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要钱 你都让我唱歌了 你让我唱歌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No money, you let me sing. You let me sing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.88,0:11:58.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才还听我唱歌 不要钱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You listen to my singing. No money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:12:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你来到莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome to Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.67,0:12:05.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 这些小城的忧郁在渐渐融化 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ That little town blues are melting away ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.64,0:12:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 我将有一个全新的开始 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ I'm gonna make a brand new start of it ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.06,0:12:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,∮ 在陈旧的纽约 ∮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}∮ In old New York ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.50,0:12:39.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莫斯科市中心的抗议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Protests in central Moscow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.46,0:12:41.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经蔓延到了俄罗斯全国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}following a day of demonstrations in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.46,0:12:43.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,骚乱源自当局被指控犯有欺诈罪…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The unrest comes as authorities have been accused of fraud
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.01,0:12:45.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来操控国家选举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}throughout the country's elections.
