Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.49,0:13:52.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肃静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵守法庭秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Order in the courtroom!
