Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.98,0:15:47.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 那些司机？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, sir... the drivers?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.03,0:15:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我引爆器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Detonator.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.91,0:16:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会很响哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gonna be loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:29.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.29,0:16:46.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.92,0:16:51.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:52.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.68,0:16:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走 走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.84,0:16:57.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.65,0:17:09.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,羁押室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.48,0:17:10.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,检查羁押室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.24,0:17:58.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.53,0:18:00.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.79,0:18:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
