Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:17.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其他人都杀掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kill the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.34,0:18:17.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.84,0:18:18.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alik.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要那份文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need this file.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.23,0:18:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put that on!
