Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.84,0:18:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCLANE: Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.89,0:19:07.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科马洛夫 科马洛夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Komarov! Komarov!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:08.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick... get the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.10,0:19:10.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快去开车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quick... get the truck!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你快回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.90,0:19:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你到底在干嘛？杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck do you think... Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事你对付不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your depth, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.52,0:19:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:22.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要抓活的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.53,0:19:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.41,0:19:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要杀了我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna shoot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.37,0:19:32.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要开枪打你老爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna shoot your own father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be here, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:37.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不该来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.13,0:19:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.43,0:19:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:50.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.85,0:19:52.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这笨蛋想压死我吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna fucking run over me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.94,0:19:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只会把事情搞得更糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're only making it worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.13,0:20:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.59,0:20:22.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有种报警啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call a cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.91,0:20:48.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 追\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白痴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.32,0:21:26.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神1号？610呼叫死神1号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaper One? Reaper One from 6-1-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在谁手上？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's got him?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.45,0:21:29.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间紧迫 福克西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Clock's running. Foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.53,0:21:30.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,锁定目标 显示图像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the paper now. Box on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.04,0:21:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到 显示图像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy that. Box on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:32.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.91,0:21:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,61 这是死神 听到请说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6-1, Reaper, we read you. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.83,0:21:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们情况怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaper, how are we looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.04,0:21:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your guy is late.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.08,0:21:39.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙的速度太慢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His rate of progress is way off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.04,0:21:41.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务时间追加6分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MET now plus 6 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.55,0:21:46.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作战总指滞后 追加6分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MCC Reaper. MET now plus 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.13,0:21:48.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不该这样的 真是难以置信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is un-frigging-believable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.39,0:21:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作战总指滞后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MCC Reaper. That's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.39,0:21:52.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不对劲 我认识这个人 他不会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's off. I know this guy. This doesn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.72,0:21:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作战总指滞后 61准备好了 待命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MCC Reaper, 6-1 is in the hole. Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.56,0:21:57.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,61 请注意 你错过时机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6-1, be advised, your window is closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:21:58.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停止攻击目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time on target is no-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.94,0:22:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重复 停止攻击目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say again, TOT is no-go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.07,0:22:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神 现在是实战 不是演习 收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaper, this is real-world, not exercise, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.07,0:22:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行 长官 警方会封闭花园环路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sir, Moscow police will have shut down the Garden Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.91,0:22:09.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神 他来不及撤离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaper! He's no-go for extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.32,0:22:11.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太晚了 终止行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late. Shut it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.41,0:22:12.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.41,0:22:14.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务终止 死神撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}6-1, mission window is closed. Reaper is out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.75,0:22:16.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:18.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我接行动组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reaper!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通知迈克·考林斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get Mike Collins looped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.34,0:22:25.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实施B计划 去安全屋 快去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell him it's Plan B, safehouse. Go now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:27.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,B计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plan B. No choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.63,0:22:28.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.93,0:22:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务终止 他们封锁了花园环路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's blown. They shut the Garden Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.43,0:22:36.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备收割 大家继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harvest is in effect. Keep on working.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.14,0:22:37.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,福克西 我们去完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's finish this, Foxy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.44,0:22:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的麦克莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, McClane!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.27,0:22:42.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.84,0:23:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.18,0:23:14.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 我话还没说完呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack! I'm not done talking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.64,0:23:19.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.85,0:23:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快开 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.21,0:23:43.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麻烦你专心点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Concentrate, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.90,0:24:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 就这样过来 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, come on through, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有本事撞我呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See if you can hit this guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.60,0:25:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙烦死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm tired of this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.15,0:25:31.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发射火箭弹 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}RPG now!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.15,0:25:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.89,0:26:00.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没打中 你小子是故意的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed! Interesting choice, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.74,0:26:18.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 嗨 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:19.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.70,0:26:20.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.41,0:26:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.42,0:26:30.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.50,0:26:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在跟我开玩笑吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be fucking kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.88,0:26:36.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.51,0:26:43.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我听得懂你说的话吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think I understand a word you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.77,0:26:48.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.39,0:26:51.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事吧 我很好 谢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I'm fine, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:02.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 伙计 你开车跟我奶奶一样慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man, you're driving like my grandma!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.37,0:27:04.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我叫你开车 你要开得飞起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I say drive, I mean fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.17,0:27:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦耶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.07,0:27:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快给我让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.41,0:27:42.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 上帝保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.50,0:27:49.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.76,0:28:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真会挑时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, for the love of...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.06,0:28:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.95,0:28:25.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.00,0:29:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看见他手势吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you see this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.63,0:29:26.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.18,0:29:28.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knock knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.66,0:29:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guess who!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.88,0:30:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我受够这混蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've had enough of this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.93,0:30:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 伙计 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.18,0:30:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这两下？就这点本事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that it? Is that your best shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.72,0:30:51.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.97,0:30:54.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.01,0:31:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 我在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.76,0:31:34.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朝上面打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.27,0:31:40.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John! Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.23,0:31:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我改主意前快上来 真是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in before I change my mind. Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就磨蹭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.41,0:31:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是怎么回事？杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, what the fuck was that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:57.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 给我闭嘴 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Shut up, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.41,0:31:59.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓这次我一定会开枪打你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swear to God, I will put a bullet in you this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.50,0:32:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为你在跟谁说话？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you think you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.16,0:32:02.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最不想见到的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last person I want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.96,0:32:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是吗 那请问刚才是谁…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, maybe you missed the whole part back there
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.46,0:32:06.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你和那个老头…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where I saved you and Papa Geppetto here
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.50,0:32:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从一帮俄罗斯恶棍手里救出来的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a whole bunch of Russian bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:10.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救我们？救我们？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You saved? You saved?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.72,0:32:12.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 救你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.26,0:32:13.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.03,0:32:16.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 你是全世界最失败的人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a world class screw-up, you know that, John?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很失败？我很失败？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a screw-up? I'm a screw-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.31,0:32:20.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我还是你老爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm still your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.39,0:32:22.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 这件事我没法改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, nothing I can do about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.48,0:32:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.77,0:32:25.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我闭嘴 别乱碰东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just shut up. Try not to touch anything, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:27.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你破坏得够多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've done enough goddamn damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.40,0:32:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见面会定在下个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The appointment is next week...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.86,0:32:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们马上开始准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will begin immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.36,0:32:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 先生 科马洛夫跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me, sir. Komarov has escaped.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.24,0:32:38.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我待会儿打给你 科马洛夫出了问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll call you back. There is a problem with Komarov.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.37,0:32:39.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.70,0:32:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人袭击了法院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some sort of attack on the courthouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.54,0:32:42.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁带走了他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who took him?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.71,0:32:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.17,0:32:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道是什么意思？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.96,0:32:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呃…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eh...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.79,0:32:48.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现场太混乱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...well it's confusing...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.75,0:32:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人看到科马洛夫…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyewitnesses say they saw Komarov...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.55,0:32:54.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟一个美国人跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...with an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.51,0:32:57.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美国人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What American?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.39,0:33:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·麦克莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.77,0:33:05.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.11,0:33:10.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你先请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.49,0:33:13.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 他来了 对 我会处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I got him. Okay, I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.07,0:33:16.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出了点意外 耽误了 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mike, we had an unexpected delay. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.45,0:33:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.57,0:33:19.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没想到会碰上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the last guy on earth I expected to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.95,0:33:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说 尤里 莫斯科有一大群人在找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, Yuri, you have half of Moscow looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.41,0:33:23.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你把衣服换掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to get dressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我来这儿干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why am I here?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.39,0:33:27.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换衣服吧 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please put on these clothes. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.17,0:33:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你手铐的钥匙 拿着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the key to your cuffs. Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 我的老天爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.88,0:33:31.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.67,0:33:32.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.51,0:33:34.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有查格林的文件吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the file on Chagarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.64,0:33:38.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你的工作？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you been doing, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.14,0:33:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗屁间谍？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spy shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.64,0:33:44.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.27,0:33:47.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是间谍？哦 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a spy? Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.61,0:33:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,新泽西州平原镇来的007\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 007 of Plainfield, New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.40,0:33:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.78,0:33:56.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱恩 闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McClane, shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.20,0:33:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别激动 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take it easy, Oddjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.87,0:34:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在度假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.87,0:34:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你妈准会高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mom will be pleased.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.37,0:34:04.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还担心你吸毒呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We thought you were doing drugs or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.33,0:34:05.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科马洛夫先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Komarov.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:08.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者贩毒 不过这是我猜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or selling drugs, but that was me, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.79,0:34:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有查格林的那份文件吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have the file on Chagarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.88,0:34:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有还是没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:16.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实很简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's very simple, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.97,0:34:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你给我文件 我带你离开俄罗斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You give me the file, and I get you out of Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.93,0:34:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就自由了 怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're a free man. What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.52,0:34:28.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无所谓 我不在乎生死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not about me. I don't care about my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.56,0:34:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,条件就这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.82,0:34:33.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没别的选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.11,0:34:36.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.11,0:34:39.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想清楚 救救你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, Yuri. Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.66,0:34:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.79,0:34:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给还是不给？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.08,0:34:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间不等人 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The clock is ticking, Yuri. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.04,0:34:51.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能带我出去？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will get me out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.09,0:34:53.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭你们三个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only the three of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.34,0:34:55.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 俄国佬 我跟他们不是一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa, Nijinsky. I'm not in the gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.71,0:34:58.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚下飞机 时差还没倒过来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just got off the plane. I'm still jet-lagged.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.17,0:35:01.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟这事没关系 对吗？杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not involved in this. Huh, Jack?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.81,0:35:06.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非能带我女儿一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only if I can take my daughter with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.73,0:35:11.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查格林的人会杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chagarin's people will kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.19,0:35:16.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 不过要快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine. Make it quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.53,0:35:18.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.61,0:35:19.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the file?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.03,0:35:23.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在普里皮亚季 不过钥匙在莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's in a vault in Prypiat, but the key is here in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.08,0:35:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在乌克兰酒店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At Hotel Ukraina.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.66,0:35:27.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.83,0:35:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打电话 我们去酒店 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make your call. We're going to the Ukraina, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.76,0:35:41.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是爸爸 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.68,0:35:44.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很好 宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine, Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.68,0:35:46.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们晚点再细说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...we'll talk later.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.22,0:35:47.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.85,0:35:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会在我和你妈妈第一次跳舞的地方等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be waiting for you where your mother and I shared our first dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.56,0:35:52.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.36,0:35:55.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要快 要快 你明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hurry! Hurry! You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.12,0:36:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 迈克 早上的事我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mike, listen, I'm sorry about this morning, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.71,0:36:16.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.67,0:36:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.72,0:36:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下 快趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.51,0:36:28.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快 快趴下 快快快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Get down! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.60,0:36:32.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 掩护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, cover!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.62,0:36:49.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来啊 哥们儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.08,0:36:54.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.67,0:37:02.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right, jerk-off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.47,0:37:03.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 约翰 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, let's move, John!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.80,0:37:05.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在度假呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on fucking vacation!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.34,0:37:07.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 动作快点 小心头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, time to hustle. Watch your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.26,0:37:10.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,麦克莱恩 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McClane, move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.43,0:37:12.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大老远跑过来 这也太扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}8,000 fucking miles for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,低一点 尤里 再低点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get down, Yuri. Stay low!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.40,0:37:20.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,头低下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.65,0:37:22.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.37,0:37:37.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么破安全屋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Safe house, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.67,0:37:44.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他知道我们是老年人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows how old we are, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.76,0:37:45.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.93,0:37:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.18,0:37:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐这儿 你没事的 别害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sit down. You're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.43,0:37:55.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.27,0:37:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要紧 没事的 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. You're fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:01.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.78,0:38:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你冷静下来 尤里 你不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calm down, Yuri, okay? You're gonna be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.78,0:38:06.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 穿上这个 穿上这个 暖和一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, put this on, stay warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.53,0:38:11.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这算什么？五分钟？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that, John? Five minutes? Five minutes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.07,0:38:13.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用五分钟就毁了我们三年的行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You blew a three-year op in five minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.34,0:38:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别客气 我还能怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're welcome! What do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.92,0:38:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么这么倒霉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.29,0:38:22.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的身份暴露了 我在这儿一个朋友都没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm so fucking burned. I got no friends in this town anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.55,0:38:25.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们中情局的人呢？联系他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your people at Langley? Just give them a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.55,0:38:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手机给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.56,0:38:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我预付了两年的话费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a two-year contract on that phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.89,0:38:40.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么？快给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you carrying? Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.07,0:38:43.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 你有现金吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. You got any cash on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.78,0:38:46.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点儿美金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some American money.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.53,0:38:48.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们在磨蹭什么？我们得赶快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? We need to keep on moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.41,0:38:52.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得给那家伙找个医生帮他处理伤口 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get this guy to a doctor. To medical attention, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.91,0:38:53.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,任务仍然有效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.12,0:38:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的任务都快流血过多而死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mission is bleeding out over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.62,0:38:58.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续执行任务 去酒店拿钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mission continues. We go to the hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.59,0:39:06.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 我们走 快走 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, let's move. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.77,0:39:18.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这也太扯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.23,0:39:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在要出去杀人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, are you going to go out and kill somebody else now?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.98,0:39:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干嘛为一个人这么兴师动众？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why all this trouble for just one guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.94,0:39:24.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是政治犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a political prisoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.23,0:39:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰 虽然你不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not that you care, John,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.48,0:39:28.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可这关系到国家安全 懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's a matter of national security, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.95,0:39:32.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有证据能扳倒查格林 我们需要他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's got the goods to stop Viktor Chagarin, and we need that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.57,0:39:33.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这样的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, great, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.78,0:39:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,送他去大使馆不就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's drop him off at the Embassy, and we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.83,0:39:38.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑？安全屋都出事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me? After what happened at the safe house?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.66,0:39:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, it doesn't work like that, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.17,0:39:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个外交烂摊子 我不过是炮灰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a huge diplomatic mess, and I'm a burnable asset.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.33,0:39:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要拿到那份文件 才能完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, I now need that file to un-fuck this mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.34,0:39:47.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有问题吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any more questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.59,0:39:49.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有 就一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.17,0:39:51.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么从来不告诉我你的下落？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come you never called and told me where you were?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.97,0:39:53.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像你关心似的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you'd give a shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.74,0:40:12.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.32,0:40:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来没法从正门进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we're not going in the front door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.25,0:40:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 慢点 慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, hold up, hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.05,0:40:34.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了 尤里 你听我说 就快搞定了 知道吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Yuri, listen to me, all right? We're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.89,0:40:37.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一拿到钥匙 就去取文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as we get that key, we're gonna grab the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.22,0:40:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后带你们离开俄罗斯 懂吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get you and your daughter out of Russia, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.39,0:40:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.02,0:40:45.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的 听我说 你表现很好 挺住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, you're doing good. All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.02,0:40:48.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再坚持一会儿 看着他 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you to hang here a second. Keep an eye on him, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.44,0:40:49.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.73,0:40:53.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别一口一个约翰的 怎么不叫我爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it with all this "John" shit? Whatever happened to "Dad?"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.03,0:40:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.87,0:41:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俄语里有个词形容他这种男人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In Russia, we have word for men like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.37,0:41:03.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,柯鲁托伊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Krutoi."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:07.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是凶悍 顽强\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means "tough," "hard."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.13,0:41:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他这样的叫不良少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In America, it means "juvenile delinquent."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.55,0:41:15.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就这一个孩子？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he your only child?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.22,0:41:20.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 我还有个女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I got a daughter, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.89,0:41:23.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.98,0:41:28.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只有一个宝贝女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have only my Solnyschka.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.57,0:41:32.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她小的时候 我一直在忙工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When she was little, I was working all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.90,0:41:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为工作是最重要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I believed work was all that mattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.33,0:41:44.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也没好好照顾孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I screwed my kid's life up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.08,0:41:46.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没日没夜地工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work all the time
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.17,0:41:49.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察没什么休息时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}around the clock most of the time, when you're a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.50,0:41:54.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那时觉得拼命工作是件…是件好事 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just thought that working all the time was a good thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.93,0:42:02.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全没照顾到他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't help him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.52,0:42:07.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还有机会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's never too late,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.77,0:42:09.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但愿如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.94,0:42:14.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.45,0:42:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里 宴会厅在酒店的哪个区域？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Yuri, which part of the building is the ballroom in?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.96,0:42:27.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在主楼里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Main tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.12,0:42:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,主楼的哪一层？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Main tower. Which floor?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.79,0:42:30.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Top floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.59,0:42:33.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保安方面呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about security?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.67,0:42:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得有保安 摄像头之类的吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember any guards? Cameras? Anything like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.67,0:42:37.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.72,0:42:39.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你…你得想起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I need you to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.39,0:42:41.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在牢里关了五年 怎么会记得？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was in prison for five years, how should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.64,0:42:43.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可能都变了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything could have changed. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.51,0:42:46.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 我知道 麻烦你好好回忆一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just think, all right? Picture it in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.02,0:42:48.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宴会厅在89年关闭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ballroom was closed in '89.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.15,0:42:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可能在重新施工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it's under construction now.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.48,0:42:52.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以那层楼没保安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So that floor's unsecured.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.07,0:42:55.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道 听着 我女儿在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know! Listen! My daughter is in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.44,0:42:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都害怕死了 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm scared to death, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.78,0:42:58.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just calm down, Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.89,0:43:25.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以前也这么干过吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess you have done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.56,0:43:29.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真聪明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.73,0:43:34.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这我也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.57,0:44:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊莲娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.57,0:44:22.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊莲娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.58,0:44:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊莲娜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.67,0:44:36.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.76,0:44:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 伊莲娜 - 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Irina. - Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.14,0:44:47.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好感人呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's tender.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.76,0:44:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也会感动？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.15,0:45:01.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要拥抱吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need a hug?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.28,0:45:06.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们家才不来这一套呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not really a hugging family.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.70,0:45:08.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.04,0:45:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还需要拿一样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We just have to get one thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.37,0:45:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就离开莫斯科远走高飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...and then we're leaving Moscow for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.12,0:45:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.13,0:45:16.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.55,0:45:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是谁？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.72,0:45:30.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年轻的那个是中情局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The young one works for CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.39,0:45:34.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,年纪大的是他爸 他们是美国人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The old one is his father. Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.98,0:45:37.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 幸亏有他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then thank God for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.32,0:45:41.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉有点不太对劲儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something no good about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:43.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴 行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just shut up, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.82,0:45:45.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说真的…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm telling you, Jack,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.82,0:45:48.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}this smells bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.33,0:45:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别说了 行吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just stop, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.33,0:45:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 你可能没法理解这种状况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This might seem like a totally foreign concept, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.87,0:45:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你喜欢硬闯 即兴发挥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you love to just run in, making shit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.29,0:46:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我是专家 我有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But like any professional, I have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.13,0:46:02.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们按计划行事 好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's just stick to it, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.09,0:46:04.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听你的就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just move your plan along.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.13,0:46:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 尤里 拿完钥匙就离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, Yuri, come on. Let's grab the key, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.01,0:46:08.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.14,0:46:10.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一会儿就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just take a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.37,0:46:30.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.99,0:46:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.42,0:46:46.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么这么快就到了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get over here so quick?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.59,0:46:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.68,0:46:54.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我走花园环路来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I took Garden Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.72,0:46:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,花园环路 那条路老是堵车 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, the Garden Ring. Supposed to always be bad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.03,0:47:10.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.45,0:47:11.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来的时候堵车吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get stuck in traffic?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.91,0:47:16.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拿到了 拿到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have it! I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.50,0:47:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎你们 美国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.97,0:47:29.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点把枪放下 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put your goddamn guns down, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.52,0:47:40.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 这是怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Papa, what is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.07,0:47:45.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把武器交出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.48,0:47:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你过来拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come and get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.12,0:47:55.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当真？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.49,0:47:57.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当真\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.41,0:48:01.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Papa.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.09,0:48:05.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.46,0:48:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放下武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.88,0:48:10.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为就你是问题少年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were a problem child.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.07,0:48:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,专家 这也是你计划好的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This a part of your plan, Mr. Professional?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.74,0:48:35.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.58,0:48:38.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了钱 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about money, papa...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.62,0:48:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几百万的美元\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...millions of dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.50,0:48:41.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我的生活很轻松吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think life was easy for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.87,0:48:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你被陷害入狱以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}While you were sitting in prison being a victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.96,0:48:46.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.29,0:48:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.63,0:48:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.68,0:48:57.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就杀了他吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should kill the old man now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.10,0:48:59.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We still need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.85,0:49:01.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以杀掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then you can kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.64,0:49:03.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.44,0:49:07.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.19,0:49:11.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的发音对不对？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I'm saying this right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.82,0:49:13.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.20,0:49:19.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道我最讨厌美国人什么吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what I hate about the Americans?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.16,0:49:22.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全都讨厌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.71,0:49:25.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤其是牛仔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Especially cowboys.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.49,0:50:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来想当一个舞蹈演员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have been a dancer. I swear to God.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.08,0:50:09.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可没人支持我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But nobody supported me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.09,0:50:15.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.59,0:50:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}have been such a
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.30,0:50:23.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太惹人讨厌了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pain in the ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.44,0:50:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.28,0:50:43.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我更喜欢跳舞 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I prefer dancing, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.87,0:50:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过杀人比在杂货店干活要过瘾多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But killing is much, much better than working in a grocery shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.13,0:50:54.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.84,0:50:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice one.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.19,0:51:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些人 太自以为是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys. So arrogant.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.36,0:51:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在不是1986年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not 1986, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.53,0:51:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里根早死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Reagan is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:30.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 哦 天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.51,0:51:41.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么好笑的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's funny there?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.72,0:51:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没法说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.68,0:51:47.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是笑你 你们的衣服很棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not you. I love these outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.35,0:51:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人也长得帅气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You guys are looking good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.10,0:51:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.80,0:51:54.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.78,0:52:00.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,够了 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was enough, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.16,0:52:05.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来跳舞吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.93,0:52:23.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点 快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.32,0:52:37.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:41.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得上次你走之前我们聊过吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the last time we talked just before you went away?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.49,0:52:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.52,0:52:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不 别在我们临死前搞煽情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna open up to me right before we die!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.54,0:52:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的风格 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not your thing, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.37,0:52:51.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的风格是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's my thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.66,0:52:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉那些坏蛋 这才像你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fucking killing bad guys, that's your thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.58,0:52:57.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你今天死不了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna die today!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.70,0:53:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.65,0:53:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.65,0:54:01.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.90,0:54:04.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没戏了 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're finished, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.79,0:54:16.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在让我来对付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm taking care of it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.68,0:54:29.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.14,0:54:38.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会变成这样 见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe this. This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.65,0:54:48.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 嗨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.87,0:54:57.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.63,0:55:02.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.51,0:55:11.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快离开这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's get out of this building!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.69,0:55:28.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.41,0:55:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.25,0:55:48.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.27,0:56:01.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,埃里克 完事了 搞定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alik, that's it. We're done!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.98,0:56:02.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.81,0:56:03.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,左转弯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Break left!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.77,0:56:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy, Commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.89,0:56:39.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到他了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have him?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.98,0:56:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.56,0:56:42.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那文件呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the file?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.64,0:56:44.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件在他手上吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.81,0:56:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要那份文件 埃里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need that file, Alik.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.19,0:56:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会带我们去拿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's taking us to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.15,0:56:52.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要再出差错了 埃里克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more mistakes, Alik.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.20,0:56:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件到手以后…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when you have the file...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.66,0:56:57.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们全干掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...kill them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.99,0:57:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.22,0:57:19.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.85,0:57:26.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚才真刺激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.36,0:57:28.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 很好玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. Loads of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.07,0:57:32.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再来一次？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanna go again?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.20,0:57:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中弹了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.53,0:57:37.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.03,0:57:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:40.04,0:57:41.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take a look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.75,0:57:43.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.41,0:57:45.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.04,0:57:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她居然为了查格林出卖自己爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe she betrayed her father for Chagarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.71,0:57:52.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在无法理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.76,0:57:56.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会理解的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday you will.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.72,0:57:59.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.56,0:58:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下一步呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's our next move?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.44,0:58:07.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.08,0:58:09.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不知道？ - 我不知道 行了吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't know? - I don't know, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.11,0:58:12.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我彻底没招了 全都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm out of moves. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.61,0:58:14.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.57,0:58:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.99,0:58:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我毁了整个任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blew the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.12,0:58:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这里没我们的事了 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, then we're done, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.42,0:58:30.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 没戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.71,0:58:31.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.00,0:58:34.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should just go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.42,0:58:37.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开莫斯科前 我们先去一下药店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll stop by a little pharmacy on our way out of Moscow,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.18,0:58:40.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你弄点…给你弄点消炎杀菌的药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get you some Merthiolate or mercury
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.93,0:58:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理一下你的小擦伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and fix up your little scratches, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.85,0:58:45.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后带你回家 买个玩具\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get you home. Get a little toy set.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.27,0:58:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝一杯加了巧克力酱的热牛奶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get yourself a nice warm glass of milk with a little Bosco in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.86,0:58:51.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿上你的中情局拖鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your CIA slippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.61,0:58:52.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.94,0:58:54.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 干嘛？ - 我懂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.53,0:58:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.49,0:59:00.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件里有什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in the file?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.78,0:59:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对查格林不利的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidence on Chagarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.12,0:59:08.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪方面的证据？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidence about what?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.46,0:59:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,切尔诺贝利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chernobyl.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.46,0:59:16.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.21,0:59:18.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,科马洛夫和查格林 他们…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Komarov and Chagarin used to have this
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.38,0:59:22.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前一起挣过非法的外快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nasty little side-racket going on back in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.85,0:59:28.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们偷偷抽取武器级铀 因为贪心…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They siphoned weapons-grade uranium, got greedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.64,0:59:31.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,导致了核泄漏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}caused the meltdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.65,0:59:35.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,后来 他们就反目了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then, you know, they fell out.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.03,0:59:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前的搭档 现在的冤家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Former partners, bad break-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.16,0:59:41.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.99,0:59:44.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以 查格林把科马洛夫弄进监狱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, Chagarin had Komarov thrown in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.91,0:59:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他关起来 忘掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, put him in a hole, forget about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.75,0:59:49.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就不用担心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't have to worry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.17,0:59:53.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你们为什么要营救他？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what happened to rescuesque?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.00,0:59:56.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他良心发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he grew a conscience.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.05,1:00:00.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？原来如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, well, that figures.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.84,1:00:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,查格林是个十足的恶棍 是危险分子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, Chagarin is bad news. He's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.22,1:00:08.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要是掌了权 他们这个国家就完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we see this guy in control, we're gonna see the whole thing fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.10,1:00:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怖主义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm talking terrorism,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.44,1:00:14.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大规模杀伤性武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}WMDS,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.90,1:00:16.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,核武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nukes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.11,1:00:22.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得有人阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someone has to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.87,1:00:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 这是我们的工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's what we do.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.54,1:00:33.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去那个叫什么的地方 做该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go out to Chiapep and we do our thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.79,1:00:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该做的事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.46,1:00:37.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.80,1:00:41.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去干掉那些坏蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We go out there and kill a lot of scumbags.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.89,1:00:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么？你有更好的计划？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? You got something better to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.48,1:00:53.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 拔吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.98,1:00:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会哭吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna cry, are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.86,1:00:57.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拔就是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.86,1:01:00.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时候哭一哭更健康 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everybody needs a good cry once in a while, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.70,1:01:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 别不好意思 - 快拔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't be ashamed. - Pull it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.36,1:01:03.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得那次…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You remember that time when
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.07,1:01:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和拉尔菲·莫斯去帮人家油漆房子吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you and Ralphie Mauser were gonna have that house-painting job?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.37,1:01:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的手指被梯子夹到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got your finger caught in the ladder,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.83,1:01:11.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回来哭了五六天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you cried for about five, six days.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.37,1:01:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快动手 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, just pull it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.08,1:01:15.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好吧 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- All right. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.42,1:01:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数到三 来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On three. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.71,1:01:19.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一 二…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One, two...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.59,1:01:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good God.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.93,1:01:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:31.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你上一次打破伤风针是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When was the last time you had a tetanus shot?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.98,1:01:38.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.61,1:01:39.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.15,1:01:42.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得弄辆车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.32,1:01:44.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.99,1:01:46.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该干活了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.13,1:02:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 专家 锁开得怎么样了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Watergate, how's that lock coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.10,1:02:10.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就快开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.85,1:02:12.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来 试试这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, try these.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.89,1:02:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.23,1:02:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你偷东西 行啊 真有你的 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, stealing. That's nice. Real nice, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.94,1:02:20.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我都被提名最佳父亲了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm up for the Father of the Year award.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.74,1:02:33.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.33,1:02:37.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.00,1:02:40.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么知道车里有这么多枪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd you know all of these guns were gonna be here?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.13,1:02:42.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿是车臣人爱来的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a Chechen hangout.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.30,1:02:44.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老板不许他们带枪进店\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Owner doesn't like guns in the club,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.17,1:02:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他们把枪留在车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so these bozos leave them in their cars.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.42,1:02:48.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这三年不是白待的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You learn a lot in three years.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.34,1:02:49.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.40,1:03:06.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你睡着了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.70,1:03:10.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刚睡了会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.87,1:03:14.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒一下时差\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jet-lag.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.92,1:03:24.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐 我们俩上一次一起坐车是什么时候？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez, when was the last time we were in a car together?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.05,1:03:29.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从特伦顿开车回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drive home from Trenton.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.09,1:03:33.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你非法持有武器去保释你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to bail you out for that weapons charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.64,1:03:34.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.81,1:03:38.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 应该是指控我开枪 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it was the fire thing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.39,1:03:40.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你把南费城给闹开了锅？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you set South Philly on fire, you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.90,1:03:46.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不抵押掉第二套房子来保释你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We had to take out a second mortgage on the house to make your bail.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.61,1:03:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我非常抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.57,1:03:50.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.29,1:04:05.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说 我们真的要去切尔诺贝利？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we really going to Chernobyl?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.13,1:04:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.76,1:04:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是那个…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Chernobyl.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.09,1:04:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个发生过核泄漏的地方？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The radioactive joint? Meltdown?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.59,1:04:14.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 就是那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.93,1:04:17.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是瑞士的那个切尔诺贝利吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not the Chernobyl in Switzerland, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.10,1:04:21.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…雪花纷飞的滑雪胜地？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all the skiing and the snow and everything?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.44,1:04:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说格勒诺布尔？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean Grenoble?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.77,1:04:27.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 抱歉 不是要去法国的格勒诺布尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, sorry, we're not going to Grenoble.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.78,1:04:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾迪·考林斯的孩子去年带他去度假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eddie Collins's kid took him on vacation last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.45,1:04:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们去了博卡拉顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They went down to Boca.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.95,1:04:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.12,1:04:41.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在赛马场玩了四天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spent four days at the track.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.33,1:04:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's nice.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.38,1:04:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那才叫放松\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's relaxing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.21,1:04:47.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 是啊 那当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.05,1:04:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为啥我们去切尔诺贝利？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go to Chernobyl?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.30,1:04:53.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 真不好意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.64,1:04:56.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边已经没有辐射污染了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all the radioactive stuff is out, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.55,1:05:34.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得这里吗？爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it as you remember, papa?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.01,1:05:36.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想回忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.30,1:05:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老顽固\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tough.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.72,1:05:42.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,文件…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The file...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.18,1:05:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在保险库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...is in the inner vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.11,1:05:49.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真感人 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very touching. Let's move.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.17,1:06:15.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是哪个？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which one is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.34,1:06:18.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走吧 老山羊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get moving, old goat.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.00,1:06:22.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(普里皮亚季)
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.25,1:06:56.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要上点油漆 除除草就能住人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couple of fresh coats of paint and a weedwacker and it's good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.93,1:07:07.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 一开始他们全盘否认事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, at first, they denied anything even happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:07.94,1:07:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天还办了场儿童游行来证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Held a children's parade the next day to prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.02,1:07:15.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时后 这儿的5万居民全部被疏散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}24 hours later, 50,000 residents were evacuated.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.99,1:07:17.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再也没有回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never came back.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.66,1:07:22.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一进保险库 科马洛夫就没命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As soon as they get in that vault, Komarov's a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.45,1:07:27.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.55,1:08:19.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有计划吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got a plan?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.51,1:08:21.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.89,1:08:25.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就看情况…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of thought we'd just wing it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.52,1:08:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,冲进去 猛开枪 打到哪儿算哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, run in, guns blazing...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.98,1:08:29.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见机行事 即兴发挥吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Making shit up as we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.85,1:08:32.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好啊 - 对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.11,1:08:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么？老古董？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is this? A pirate gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.73,1:08:40.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 是挺老的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. It's old school, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.53,1:08:41.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.95,1:08:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 就像我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, like me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.53,1:08:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有时间 我要跟你好好谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of these days, I'm gonna have a long talk with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.10,1:09:07.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Jack,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.72,1:09:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾你的搭档死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry your partner got killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.89,1:09:16.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉破坏了你们的计划 我不是故意的 真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry I fucked up your day. That wasn't my plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.23,1:09:20.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你惹了麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I caused you problems.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.40,1:09:23.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来…不是想给你添乱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I came here for something else.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.58,1:09:30.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然碰上一大堆破事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And all that other bullshit. I mean,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.33,1:09:36.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a pretty good day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.59,1:09:41.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你到处跑 挺好玩的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's fun, running around with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.43,1:09:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见到你很开心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.19,1:09:57.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你 儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.32,1:10:04.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.03,1:10:09.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会罩着你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to know I got your back.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.87,1:10:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got yours, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.29,1:10:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 我们去干掉那些混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Let's go kill some motherfuckers.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.49,1:10:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Key.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.83,1:12:18.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 这到底在搞什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, what the fuck is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.04,1:12:22.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的耐心是有限度的 文件最好在里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm losing my patience. The fucking file better be here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.09,1:12:29.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,辐射在这个房间里累积了几十年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radiation has been pooling in this room for decades.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.55,1:12:34.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的老爸 你太小看我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've underestimated us, Daddy dearest.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.35,1:12:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把它搬进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring it in!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.82,1:13:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Atta boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.99,1:13:38.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:39.70,1:13:44.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是化合物274 它能中和辐射 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Compound 27-4. It neutralizes radiation, trust me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.37,1:14:28.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全了 可以脱掉防护服了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All clear. We can ditch the suits.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.50,1:15:08.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么鬼东西？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.08,1:15:13.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是价值10亿欧元的浓缩铀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One billion euros worth of enriched uranium.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.26,1:15:16.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.97,1:15:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心 它在这种状态下很稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, it's stable in this form.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.10,1:15:22.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去拿文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}File!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.14,1:15:27.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊莲娜 少废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina, cut the crap, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.44,1:15:31.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这儿没人关心铀的事 文件在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one here is speaking about uranium. Where's the file?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.07,1:15:35.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别兜圈子了 文件在哪儿？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No more games, where is the file?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.99,1:15:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这已经不关你的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's no longer your concern.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.73,1:16:09.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sunshine...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.44,1:16:11.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you did well.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.36,1:16:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说过…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.36,1:16:18.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都会顺利的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...everything would work out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.66,1:16:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到爸爸这儿来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.34,1:16:37.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸 你是个天才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pap, You're a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.01,1:16:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.89,1:16:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装货吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Load it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.93,1:16:49.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕加斯？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pegasus?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.48,1:16:51.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.11,1:17:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装个文件要这么大的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of hardware for a file.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.79,1:17:53.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,五分钟后起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wheels up in five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.00,1:17:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.00,1:18:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.33,1:18:39.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,队伍抽调完毕 交给你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Team extraction completed. She's all yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.84,1:18:40.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.87,1:19:12.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你进去了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you inside?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.83,1:19:13.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的 维克多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, yes, Viktor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.08,1:19:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.21,1:19:21.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.84,1:19:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很惊讶吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You surprised?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.01,1:19:28.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在就在这一切开始的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in the same place where it all started...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.34,1:19:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你背叛我之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...before you betrayed me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.85,1:19:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.56,1:19:37.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你承诺还给我原来的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...you promised to give me my life back.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.35,1:19:39.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经做到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave it back to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.36,1:19:42.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thank you for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.73,1:19:46.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.74,1:19:48.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要你的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...I'm going to take yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.27,1:20:19.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静电4号 我们准备起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Static 4, we are ready for take off.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.06,1:20:24.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,静电4号 收到没有？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Static 4, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.57,1:20:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.70,1:20:36.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尤里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yuri.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.29,1:20:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个跳舞的呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's the dancer?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.91,1:20:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧？你受伤了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay? You hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.42,1:20:42.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.79,1:20:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…我很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.59,1:20:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事 我只是…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.81,1:20:59.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,箱子里装的是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in these boxes?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.31,1:21:04.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地 你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank God you're here, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.44,1:21:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.07,1:21:08.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们随时会回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're coming back any minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.15,1:21:13.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去…我去拿文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let me get the file.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.95,1:21:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,箱子里装了什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's in the boxes?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.99,1:21:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是铀235\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's U-235.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.12,1:21:25.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武器级的铀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Weapons-grade uranium.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.29,1:21:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是防护箱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Armored cases.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.97,1:21:36.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,造炸弹的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bomb kind?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.14,1:21:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 就是那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, the bomb kind.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.31,1:21:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先别急着走 伙计\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not so fast, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.98,1:21:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.15,1:21:51.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 有一点儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.82,1:21:53.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去拿文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm getting the file.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.49,1:21:57.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 你不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.16,1:22:01.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,钥匙是你保险库的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The key. It's your vault, isn't it, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.45,1:22:04.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？不 不 我…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No. No, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.83,1:22:06.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些是你放在这儿的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put this shit in here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.79,1:22:07.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.92,1:22:08.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.42,1:22:11.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道这事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't know, Jack.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.26,1:22:21.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,地上是那个跳舞的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that the dancer down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.31,1:22:23.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在胡说什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.02,1:22:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那家伙死了怪可惜的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a tough break for a good athlete.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.44,1:22:28.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克 你了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jack, you know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.11,1:22:33.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 我了解你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know you. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.61,1:22:37.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我更了解他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know him better.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.83,1:22:43.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,根本就没什么文件 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never was a file, was there, Yuri?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.38,1:22:54.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course there was no file.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.38,1:22:57.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只不过是个诱饵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was simply bait.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.22,1:23:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要的东西在这个保险库里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I needed was in this vault.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.14,1:23:03.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有查格林有能力…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chagarin was the only one with enough
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.10,1:23:04.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我从监狱里弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}power and influence to get me out of jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.89,1:23:08.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我利用了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used him.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.06,1:23:11.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也利用了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.32,1:23:16.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是为了钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's about money.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.74,1:23:18.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪次不是为了钱？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When's it not about money?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:18.49,1:23:19.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想逮捕我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want to arrest me?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.03,1:23:26.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是你的辖区吧 麦克莱恩警探 对吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your jurisdiction, Detective McClane, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.71,1:23:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个问题用不着你操心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't worry too much about being arrested.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.38,1:23:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我儿子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, my boy
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.92,1:23:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是中情局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is in the CIA.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.21,1:23:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以先斩后奏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No phone call.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.26,1:23:39.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spy shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.26,1:23:44.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 该死的美国人 觉得自己很聪明吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goddamn Americans. You think you're so smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.06,1:23:48.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没那么聪明 我是来度假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not that smart. I'm just on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.85,1:23:50.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My boy here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.06,1:23:53.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会好好教训你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gonna put a whooping on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.01,1:23:54.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.07,1:24:01.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.62,1:24:11.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟你女儿说再见吧 混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can say goodbye to your daughter, you dumbwit fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.13,1:24:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的宝贝在哪儿呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's your little Soltschanitsa?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.65,1:24:34.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼 该死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit! God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.32,1:24:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.01,1:25:05.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伊莲娜 我去楼顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Irina, I'm going to the roof...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.55,1:25:06.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,楼顶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The roof!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.35,1:25:10.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCLANE: Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.04,1:25:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,调到91\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Set at 91.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.16,1:25:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,动力系统？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power plant?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.25,1:25:32.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All good to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.21,1:25:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.11,1:26:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,厉害啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Subtle.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.78,1:26:06.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的手雷是用什么做的？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is in those goddamn grenades?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.08,1:26:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去抓他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.67,1:26:17.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去搞定直升机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to the helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.39,1:27:14.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,范蒂姆 去机尾看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vadim, watch the tail.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.31,1:27:16.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,收到 高度120米…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Copy. You are at 120 meters...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.39,1:27:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,115米\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...115 meters...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.42,1:27:47.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,楼顶有人交火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is small arms fire coming from the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.52,1:28:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们有客人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.11,1:28:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去机尾看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hatch the tail for me there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.20,1:28:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.20,1:28:15.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.79,1:28:17.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,范蒂姆 给我接通武器控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vadim, give me firing control now...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.58,1:28:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,正在接通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engaging!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.46,1:28:26.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}McCLANE: Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.59,1:28:30.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.59,1:28:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愿意效劳 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With pleasure, papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.39,1:28:40.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是来度假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on fucking vacation!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.23,1:28:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,范蒂姆 他在那儿 我看到他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vadim! He is there! I see him!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.07,1:28:54.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为孩子拼老命了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The shit we do for our kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.57,1:28:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我斗 玩死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yippee ki-yay, motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.96,1:29:01.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.92,1:29:12.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飞机失去平衡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}CG's shifted...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.13,1:29:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前进速度已经调到最大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got full forward cyclic.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.50,1:29:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要失去控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.92,1:29:50.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的天呐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.68,1:29:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,干得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.31,1:29:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,超级间谍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Super-spy.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.77,1:30:06.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惜你爸没法活着看到你升官了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a shame your father won't be alive to see you promoted.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:09.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neither will you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.25,1:30:26.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨 杰克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Jack!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.84,1:30:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坚持住 约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on, John!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.38,1:31:09.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.30,1:31:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.35,1:31:26.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没有弹药了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're out of ammunition!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.23,1:31:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.10,1:31:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狗杂种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bastards.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.48,1:31:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈的要干什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.11,1:31:35.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来为你报仇 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is for you, papa.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.01,1:32:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.80,1:32:44.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.35,1:32:47.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.98,1:32:55.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.90,1:33:02.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:04.45,1:33:05.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.77,1:33:34.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才叫我爸爸？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just call me Dad?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.06,1:33:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:38.73,1:33:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.03,1:33:43.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你幻听了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.61,1:33:47.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耳朵进水了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got swimmer's ear.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.25,1:33:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会多长出个手臂什么的吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not gonna grow any third arms or anything, are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.42,1:34:00.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.05,1:34:02.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过你可能会秃头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might lose your hair.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.42,1:34:04.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laugh it up, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.22,1:34:07.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再过五年你也会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is you, five years from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.22,1:34:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是雨水 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's rainwater. You'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.39,1:34:13.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再说了 麦克莱恩家的人没那么容易死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, it's hard to kill a McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.06,1:34:16.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是麦克莱恩家的人？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now you're a McClane?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.11,1:34:20.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对 我是麦克莱恩家的人 约翰·麦克莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm a McClane. John McClane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.57,1:34:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小约翰·麦克莱恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John McClane Junior.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.07,1:34:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哦 那你就是老约翰了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that makes you a "senior."
Dialogue: 0,1:34:25.70,1:34:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.37,1:34:28.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别忘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Try not to forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.08,1:34:30.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.12,1:34:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得学会尊重长辈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have some respect for your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.92,1:34:37.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我问你件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.13,1:34:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你爱找麻烦？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you go looking for trouble
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.42,1:34:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是麻烦总是来找你？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or does it always just seem to find you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.63,1:34:48.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗 这么多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, after all these years,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.47,1:34:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己也没想明白过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I still ask myself the same question.
